        },
        {
          "text": " “I am the true vine, and my Father is the vinedresser. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Every branch of mine that bears no fruit, he takes away, and every branch that does bear fruit he prunes, that it may bear more fruit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.13.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 13.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " You are already made clean by the word which I have spoken to you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.6.56"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 6.56",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.2.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Jn 2.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abide in me, and I in you. As the branch cannot bear fruit by itself, unless it abides in the vine, neither can you, unless you abide in me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am the vine, you are the branches. He who abides in me, and I in him, he it is that bears much fruit, for apart from me you can do nothing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If a man does not abide in me, he is cast forth as a branch and withers; and the branches are gathered, thrown into the fire and burned. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.14.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 14.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.16.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.7.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 7.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JAS.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jas 1.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " If you abide in me, and my words abide in you, ask whatever you will, and it shall be done for you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 5.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " By this my Father is glorified, that you bear much fruit, and so prove to be my disciples. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As the Father has loved me, so have I loved you; abide in my love. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.14.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 14.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.5.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Jn 5.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " If you keep my commandments, you will abide in my love, just as I have kept my Father's commandments and abide in his love. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These things I have spoken to you, that my joy may be in you, and that your joy may be full.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
